<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan seeks full range Apr 1-20 naphtha by tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan seeks full range Apr 1-20 naphtha by tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has tendered to buy 30,000 tonnes of full range naphtha for delivery April 1-30 to Kaohsiung, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender closes March 10 and is valid until March 12.</p>
<p>CPC's last full range purchase for March 11-20 delivery was at $239-$240 per tonne on a cost-and-freight basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
